# Fruit Search — Game Overview

**Slug:** `fruit-search`  
**Site path:** `/games/fruit-search/`  
**Status:** in production (build in progress)  
**Unlock:** requires `fruit-search-unlocked` · reward code `TRACE-A-Z-4`  
**Prior art:** `G:\Laughing Dragons\Laughing-Dragons.com\Laughing dragons matching game\`

## Pitch

Where's-Waldo style I-Spy with the Fruit Friends A–Z cast. A busy map, a prompt ("Find Adam the Apple!" or "Find letter M!"), tap the right friend, celebrate, next target. Kid-friendly misses, replay forever.

## Core loop

1. HUD shows target portrait + name or letter  
2. Player scans map (scroll on mobile)  
3. Tap a sprite hitbox  
4. Correct → celebrate, score +1, new target  
5. Wrong → gentle "Try again!"  
6. After 5 finds → round clear → play again / next map

## Modes (v1)

| Mode | Prompt example |
|------|----------------|
| Name (default) | Find Benjamin the Banana! |
| Letter | Find the fruit that starts with M! |

## Difficulty

| Tier | Map | Crowd | Sprite scale |
|------|-----|-------|--------------|
| Easy | map-1 | 6–8 | large |
| Medium | map-2 | 10–14 | medium |
| Hard | map-3 | 16–22 | small |

## Out of scope v1

- Drago clue mode, audio polish, full A–Z sprites if art incomplete  
- AdSense on page until `status: live`

